" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13.2 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Daunting Gaze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Drains Power instantly and stuns the target opponent. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer/Enchanter/Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lightning Surge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cerebral Spasm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals mental damage over time and drains power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blink </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">A short distance teleport. Also reduces aggro. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Overwhelming Silence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Drains Power over-time and prevents the target opponent from casting spells or using abilities. (This excludes 