 valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Illusion: Half Elf </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Turn yourself into a Half Elf. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Illusion: Human </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Turn yourself into a Human. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blessing of the Prism </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the power pool, arcane mitigateion and spell avoidance for all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Entrance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Single target mez. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Phantasmal Splendor </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Mesmerizes the target opponent and surrounding encounter members. Costs Power periodically and completely immobilizes the ca