iddle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bewildering Cascade </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect stun spell. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Group Illusion: Human </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Turns your entire group into humans. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Nightmare </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals damage over time, reduces arcane resistance, and has a chance to deal additional mental damage whenever the target is successfully hit (for the duration of the spell). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Tormenting Visions </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals mental damage over time and has a chance to decrease the targets melee dmg for a short period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Construct of Order </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons an illusory pet that attack the current target until spell expiration. If the pet is killed before expiration, it will bu