ence on the party for a short period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Group Illusion: Half Elf </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Turns the casters group into Half Elfs. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Convincing Regalia </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mezs the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Drain Will </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Stuns the target plus large power drain. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Siphon Self </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Converts the casters health to power over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Illusionist </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Withered Hope </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases the targets arcane resistance, deals mental damage over time, and as the chance to